# Browser
# Two Ancient Adamantoises, played by Bot1's page. Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1 meets both redirections, and the page asks
# which applies first (CR 616.1), saying what the damage is and whom it would be dealt to, and that the others that still
# apply then do, each once (CR 614.5, 616.1f): the one chosen first passes the damage to the other. Its two buttons read the
# same while the two are alike, and Bot1 takes #1's effect: #2 is dealt the 3. At the second Bolt the buttons tell them
# apart by the damage #2 has marked; Bot1 takes #2's effect and #1 is dealt 3. Bot1 loses no life. The damage stays on
# both through the cleanup step (CR 514.2), and the page still draws it on Bot1's next turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Ancient Adamantoise
Forest
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = 3 damage from Lightning Bolt to you: which applies first?
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = 2 effects want to change this  ·  then each other one that still applies does, once
? Client.Bot1.Dock = Ancient Adamantoise: the damage is dealt to this creature instead; Ancient Adamantoise: the damage is dealt to this creature instead
Bot1.Replace(Ancient Adamantoise#1)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1.Damage = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#2.Damage = 3
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Dock = Ancient Adamantoise: the damage is dealt to this creature instead; Ancient Adamantoise (3 damage marked): the damage is dealt to this creature instead
Bot1.Replace(Ancient Adamantoise#2)
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise.Damage = -3

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1.Damage = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#2.Damage = 3
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt
